---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-[#E5E5E5] bg-[#F8F9FA] mt-16 text-[#525252] text-xs sm:text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-[1160px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Purpose -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="font-bold text-[#14213D] text-base">KalkulatorSeller</div>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Alat hitung mandiri untuk seller online Indonesia. Menghitung modal, potongan marketplace, dan margin profit bersih sebelum menentukan harga jual.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigasi Cepat -->
      <div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-[#14213D] mb-2.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Kalkulator Platform</div>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-none p-0 m-0 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/shopee" class="hover:text-[#14213D] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Kalkulator Shopee</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tiktok-shop" class="hover:text-[#14213D] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Kalkulator TikTok Shop</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tokopedia" class="hover:text-[#14213D] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Kalkulator Tokopedia</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tarif" class="hover:text-[#14213D] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Transparansi Skema Tarif</a></li>
          <li><a href="/panduan" class="hover:text-[#14213D] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Panduan Penggunaan</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Legal & Privasi -->
      <div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-[#14213D] mb-2.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Ketentuan & Privasi</div>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-none p-0 m-0 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-[#14213D] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Kebijakan Privasi (Data Lokal)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms" class="hover:text-[#14213D] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Syarat & Ketentuan</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-4 p-2.5 bg-white border border-[#E5E5E5] rounded text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Perhatian:</strong> KalkulatorSeller adalah alat simulasi independen dan tidak terafiliasi resmi dengan Shopee, TikTok Shop, atau Tokopedia.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar: Disclaimer & Copyright -->
    <div class="border-t border-[#E5E5E5] pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[11px] text-[#525252]">
      <p class="m-0 text-center sm:text-left">
        Hasil kalkulasi adalah estimasi simulasi berdasarkan aturan tarif publik yang terverifikasi. Selalu periksa tagihan aktual di Seller Center resmi Anda.
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 shrink-0">
        &copy; {currentYear} KalkulatorSeller.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
